===Be the Best! Pokémon B+W===
A Rich Boy by the name of '''Dol''' (Japanese: '''ドル''' ''Dol'') appears in [[Be the Best! Pokémon B+W]].

[[Monta]] meets him on the [[Battle Subway]] and asks him for a battle. He sends out his powerful {{p|Bouffalant}} and {{p|Swoobat}}, quickly defeating [[Monta's Snivy]] and {{p|Boldore}}. Several days later, Monta asks him for a rematch, which he accepts. Despite him expecting the same outcome, Monta presses on, and with his Pokémon's new moves and held items, he finally manages to defeat Dol.

